Generated runtime blocklist artifacts may contain data derived from Block List
Project Lists (Unlicense), StevenBlack/hosts (MIT), dibdot DoH-IP-blocklists
(GPL-3.0-only), and HaGeZi DNS Blocklists (GPL-3.0-only). Artifact manifests
identify each source, license, and transformation version. These data artifacts
are distributed separately from the Apache-2.0 application code.

The HaGeZi upstream repository was deleted in August 2026. The bypass and social
categories include vendored snapshots of its lists, captured 2026-08-11 from the
jsDelivr CDN cache at builds 2026.0809 and 2026.0805 respectively. They are
checked in under tools/blocklists/data/ with their original headers intact, are
frozen, and remain GPL-3.0-only. Each category also carries a maintained live
source, so the snapshots supplement rather than replace ongoing updates.
